Instructions for running the SimpleXMQ servers as system daemons:

The package installs rc.d scripts for both daemons:

- `smp-server`
- `xftp-server`

The first start requires initializing each server once so that its
configuration, certificates, and state directories are created.

Example:

```sh
doas rcctl enable smp-server xftp-server
doas -u _simplexmq /usr/local/bin/smp-server init
doas -u _simplexmq /usr/local/bin/xftp-server init
doas rcctl start smp-server
doas rcctl start xftp-server
```

The servers store their configuration under `/etc/simplex/` and runtime data
under `/var/simplex/`.
